WEBVTT

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.070
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.840
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.180
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.020
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.720
With you guys

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.720
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.390
If we join forces

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.360
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.700
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:02.870
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:09.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.080
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.020
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:17.150
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:22.320
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.330
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.030
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:33.070
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:35.940
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:39.940
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.140
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:54.920
Someone once said...

00:01:55.320 --> 00:02:01.960
There's a lion that's covered in a 
deep-fried crisp, delicious coating...

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:06.270
Fryon!

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:15.640
There's a hermit crab that carries 
soft, freshly-baked cornet bread...

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:19.410
Cornet Crab!

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:28.260
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:33.390
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:40.730
Granny Chiyo, now with the enemy, 
Gourmet Corp, attacked Chowlin Temple.

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:43.940
She defeated Master Chin Chin-Chin!

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:57.220
Chiyo-san! That's enough!

00:02:57.620 --> 00:02:59.290
Here he comes!

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:02.820
That's my partner.

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:09.260
Surprisingly, Otake's partner is 
Starjun, a Vice-chef of Gourmet Corp.

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:14.970
Because they were old friends, Komatsu 
resolves to stand up to Otake.

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:31.480
The Legendary Ingredient, "Center"! 
Ichiryu and the Strongest Biotope, 0!

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:41.430
Chiru-san!

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:44.560
I never thought the Master would 
sustain injuries like this.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:46.430
Don't tell me it was Chiyo-san...

00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:49.530
Master Chin!

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:51.170
Revival Knife!

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:53.500
I'm going to use a dark technique.

00:03:54.910 --> 00:03:56.240
Revival Knife...

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:58.340
Yes.

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:23.700
Master!

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.130
Master Chin...

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:33.110
Now he needs nutrients.

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:35.910
Do you have the temple 
treasure, Bubble Fruit?

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.050
Is this enough?

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:39.820
Toriko-san!

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:42.520
That's plenty.

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:47.820
Wow! Is that the genuine Bubble Fruit?!

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:53.460
Alright, Master. Stay as 
you are and please eat.

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:02.770
Master...

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:05.270
His wounds are closing...

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:07.640
What exactly are Revival Knives?

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:10.110
Revival Knives are made from

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:14.380
creatures and minerals that have 
the power to regenerate cells.

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:17.790
Cutting ingredients with these knives 
seems to bring them back to life,

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:21.360
as cell division takes place from the 
cut area, revitalizing the cells.

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:24.260
Maybe earlier...

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:28.100
...when my stab wound healed instantly...

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:30.160
...it was this kind of knife!

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:33.370
But it takes superhuman skill

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:37.840
to be able to slide the knife between 
the cells without damaging them.

00:05:38.570 --> 00:05:43.240
If you master the skill, you can also 
eat one ingredient in perpetuity.

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:47.850
But the IGO is concerned that could 
wreak havoc on food distribution,

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:51.350
so it has prohibited the 
skill as a "dark technique".

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:55.320
But you learned that dark 
technique, Chiru-san?

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:58.160
I only have a beginner's 
skill with the technique.

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:00.660
All I can do is promote healing.

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:02.330
Really?

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:06.170
The person can have an effective 
recovery if they simultaneously

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:08.300
eat ingredients with high nutritional value.

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:10.900
On the other hand...

00:06:13.710 --> 00:06:16.680
...lives that have already been lost

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:18.440
can't be revived.

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.950
The revival of the dead...

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:29.960
That's none other than the reason

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:33.930
Granny Chiyo defected to Gourmet Corp.

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:35.130
Master Chin!

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.460
Are you okay?!

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:43.170
Bubble Fruit...

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:47.410
Although actually, if you peel the 
thin skin, it becomes more flavorful

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:49.170
and the savoriness increases too...

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:54.150
Chiyo-chan was most skilled 
at preparing this.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:59.550
I apologize. I'm still inexperienced. 
The former master chef's skill was...

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:02.420
Cooking with Bubble Fruit

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:05.720
is difficult, even for a chef 
who's mastered Honoring the Food.

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:07.960
Chiyo-chan was a prodigy.

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:11.060
Master! You mentioned revival of the dead...

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:13.760
That was the reason Chiyo-san defected?!

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:15.470
What do you mean?!

00:07:19.270 --> 00:07:21.440
The reason I joined them?

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:24.870
I can't fight you with that 
knowledge, Chiyo-chan.

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:27.340
I did it to procure a certain ingredient!

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:29.380
What is it? GOD?!

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:32.550
It's the eighth hidden ingredient

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:34.850
from Acacia's Full Course!

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.450
What?!

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:37.790
How do you know about that?!

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:40.660
You know about it, don't you, Chin-chan?

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:41.360
No.

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:45.060
Even we, the members of Biotope 0,

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:49.000
didn't hear about that 
ingredient from the president.

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:53.070
At least not then...

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:54.840
Then?!

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:57.670
Gratitude! Gratitude!

00:07:57.670 --> 00:08:02.680
At the time, you kept lecturing me to 
be grateful for everything that happens!

00:08:04.850 --> 00:08:08.820
Right after my son died!

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:19.730
Who in the world gave you that information?

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:22.960
It may be nothing more than a legend.

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:24.970
After everything, you say that?

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:29.670
Even GOD is still a legend!

00:08:29.670 --> 00:08:32.440
Instead of being grateful 
for an unreachable past,

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:34.980
I'd rather reach out towards the 
future, even if it is a myth!

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:37.080
Who was it?

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:40.150
Who egged you on? Gourmet Corp?!

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:41.750
Maybe...

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:44.350
I don't know who he was.

00:08:44.350 --> 00:08:48.590
But his words had the ring of truth.

00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:52.930
At least compared to

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:56.000
your empty, meaningless gratitude!

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:07.970
That happened to Chiyo-san?

00:09:07.970 --> 00:09:13.210
Chiyo would always count how old 
her son would be if he still lived.

00:09:13.810 --> 00:09:16.420
Of course that upset me.

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:21.320
Because he was my son too...

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:27.460
Reviving the dead...

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:33.200
Does Acacia's Full Course really have 
an ingredient that can revive the dead?

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:35.030
I don't know.

00:09:35.030 --> 00:09:39.340
But Acacia sealed seven 
dishes of his Full Course.

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:44.380
It's missing the eighth 
ingredient, the hors d'oeuvre.

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:49.350
This idea that Acacia purposely hid that 
ingredient is probably true anyway.

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:51.450
Come to think of it,

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:53.490
when we went to the Gourmet Shrine before,

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:57.120
you noticed that there were 
only seven food temples

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:59.360
representing Acacia's Full Course,

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:01.090
right, Komatsu?

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:04.700
Komatsu?

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:06.760
Maybe...

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:09.030
...Take-chan too...

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:13.940
It's possible that the 
ingredient they're after

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:16.370
isn't only GOD.

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:18.440
Though their purpose is unclear...

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:22.080
We mustn't let Gourmet 
Corp gain the initiative.

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:26.650
I've already informed IGO's 
Biotope 0 about today's events.

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:28.690
Biotope 0?!

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:35.160
Gourmet World Cloud Tree

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:32.090
They research and develop ingredients there.

00:10:32.090 --> 00:10:35.590
And sometimes, that's where 
they monitor the Nitro.

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:40.360
Biotope 0

00:10:35.590 --> 00:10:39.800
But it's a top secret IGO 
facility in the Gourmet World.

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:41.870
There are less than 20 employees,

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:46.200
all powerful people handpicked 
by the president.

00:10:48.470 --> 00:10:50.140
How long's it been since the last time

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:52.980
I left the Road of Three Hells?!

00:10:52.980 --> 00:10:56.810
I can't remember the last time 
I got to leave Honey Prison!

00:10:56.810 --> 00:11:00.020
Um... Who are you?

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:03.520
Spaced out as ever, eh, Guemon?

00:11:03.520 --> 00:11:06.060
Last time was probably when 
I introduced you to Sunny.

00:11:07.760 --> 00:11:09.860
Well, if it isn't Yosaku.

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:13.500
Hey, would you capture Zebra-chan again?

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:15.900
Sure, and that's a promise.

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:18.470
But the president's gotta give the order.

00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:20.940
I'm gonna take this opportunity to complain

00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:24.670
to the president about dear Zebra-chan's 
way too easy conditions for release!

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:26.880
The Gourmet World, huh?

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:29.140
Melk! How long's it been?

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:32.980
Can't hear ya.

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:36.020
I said I can't hear ya!

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:39.820
You're late,

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:42.460
members of Biotope 0!

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:45.230
You finally got here!

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:48.960
At last, the war is at hand.

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:51.930
Brace yourselves, people!

00:12:12.590 --> 00:12:14.590
Hey, how many years has it been

00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:17.320
since all the members have gotten together?!

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:19.430
It's not all of us.

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:25.060
Gourmet Literary Writer, Malisman
Gourmet National Treasure

00:12:19.430 --> 00:12:23.400
Guemon, your memory must be like Swiss 
cheese from spacing out so much.

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:25.430
Master Chin isn't here with us, is he?

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:27.370
Hey, Chin-Chin ain't here!

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:31.500
Gourmet Seitai Master, Malee

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:29.140
Where'd Chin-Chin go, huh?!

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:29.970
Where's Chin-Chin?!

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:31.700
Stop saying "Chin-Chin."

00:12:31.700 --> 00:12:32.940
President...

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:35.980
Is it true that Master Chin was attacked?

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:40.480
I was contacted directly by the man himself.

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:43.480
Well, it seems his life isn't in danger,

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:45.480
but I think he suffered serious injuries.

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:47.720
Anyway, we're here for a different matter.

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:55.060
Hard to imagine somebody like 
Chin-san getting beaten in a fight.

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:55.160
Ultimate Pot Artisan Kuribo (Maker 
of the Worlds Strongest Pots)

00:12:56.930 --> 00:12:58.930
Was his opponent somebody from Gourmet Corp?

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:08.270
Gourmet Mountain Bandit Goblin Ramon

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:04.670
I'm sure they used some underhanded tactics.

00:13:04.670 --> 00:13:08.810
It'd take a lot more'n that to kill that 
old man, so nothin' to worry about.

00:13:09.210 --> 00:13:10.480
True.

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:12.110
As you say.

00:13:12.110 --> 00:13:17.220
At any rate, it's a rare occurrence 
for even most of us to be together.

00:13:12.610 --> 00:13:19.950
Gourmet Magician Manan (Gourmet Hunter)

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:19.920
So President, could you 
tell us why we're here?

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:35.800
Gourmet Corp has found out 
about the existence of CENTER.

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:38.070
What?!

00:13:38.070 --> 00:13:39.640
CENTER?!

00:13:38.070 --> 00:13:47.240
Tack, Warrior of the Goro 
Tribe (Gourmet Hunter)

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:43.640
The legendary ingredient that's 
said to be Acacia's hors d'oeuvre.

00:13:43.640 --> 00:13:47.440
Does the ultimate reviving 
ingredient really exist?

00:13:47.440 --> 00:13:54.150
Assassin Megarodras

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:49.610
So it's true?

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:53.980
The rumors were true, Mr. President?

00:13:54.350 --> 00:14:04.530
Martial Artist Sakura (Gourmet Hunter)

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:57.650
If it is true, that's significant news

00:13:57.650 --> 00:13:59.560
and I'm extremely interested.

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:00.790
However,

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:04.730
how did Gourmet Corp get a hold 
of that kind of information?

00:14:04.730 --> 00:14:07.160
That's simple.

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:08.730
It means

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:11.370
one of us passed on the info to them.

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:19.540
Just kidding!

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:22.280
I don't remember inviting 
anybody here who would do that.

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:25.450
I disagree. There is someone 
here that I suspect.

00:14:25.450 --> 00:14:28.150
He's become a member only recently.

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:37.930
Former Boss of the Gourmet 
Mafia, Ryu (Gourmet Hunter)

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:47.740
Hey, Rapp, watch what you say.

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:50.040
I'm the one that brought Ryu here.

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:53.040
He ain't the kinda man to pull that crap.

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:54.840
Not convinced...

00:14:54.840 --> 00:14:56.240
Well, okay.

00:14:56.240 --> 00:14:58.550
We can't help that the info leaked.

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:02.950
All we have to do is get those 
ingredients before they do.

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:06.050
And so, at last...

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:11.660
We're going to gather Acacia's Full 
Course, with GOD as the main dish.

00:15:14.530 --> 00:15:18.130
Rala, have you narrowed down the 
timetable of the Gourmet Eclipse?

00:15:18.130 --> 00:15:18.730
Yes.

00:15:19.130 --> 00:15:23.500
According to the results of my latest 
research, the Gourmet Eclipse

00:15:19.130 --> 00:15:25.010
Gourmet Astronomer Rala (Gourmet Hunter)

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:24.970
could happen in as much 
as six months from now.

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:27.870
Half a year, huh? That's fast.

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:31.010
Yosaku, will that be enough 
time to revive EARTH?

00:15:31.210 --> 00:15:32.610
Yeah.

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:35.580
I'll be done in a little more than a month.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:38.520
Melk, how is the knife to prepare AIR coming?

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:41.820
What's that?

00:15:41.820 --> 00:15:44.490
He says it's done already.

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:45.460
Alright.

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:48.760
Kosairo, what about the location of ATOM?

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:51.530
Gourmet Hermit Kosairo

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:51.030
We've almost cracked it.

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:53.470
Atashino.

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:58.440
Gourmet Surgeon Atashino (Chef)

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:54.330
Yes.

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:56.270
I'm counting on you to prepare it.

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:58.840
Please leave it to me, President.

00:15:58.840 --> 00:15:59.870
Listen up.

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:03.910
It's possible that this'll take us 
right into a war with Gourmet Corp.

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:05.780
So be prepared!

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:08.950
If it comes to that, we're the only ones

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:11.050
who can fight here in the Gourmet World.

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:12.320
Each of you,

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:16.990
be ready to turn your current work over 
to a successor in the Human World.

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:19.590
Alright then!

00:16:20.760 --> 00:16:21.860
Let's move out!

00:16:21.860 --> 00:16:23.130
Yeah!

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:29.600
Been a while, but what 
do you say we get rowdy?!

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:33.670
I can't wait!

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:36.810
Fighting over food is foolish,

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:39.540
but when our opponent is Gourmet 
Corp, there's no other choice.

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:41.110
President!

00:16:42.510 --> 00:16:45.580
I'd rather not bring this up with 
things so hectic in the Gourmet World,

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:48.120
but with the Gourmet Eclipse approaching,

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:50.490
<i>it</i> is going to make a move.

00:16:50.720 --> 00:16:55.190
Already, the Four Beasts have awakened 
after hundreds of years hibernating.

00:16:55.190 --> 00:16:58.560
At this rate, the Human 
World will be in danger.

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:04.770
Except right now, we've 
got our hands full here.

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:07.340
Yeah, but don't worry about it.

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:12.010
The Four Beasts are their 
final training ingredient.

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:13.840
Training?

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:16.510
Even outside the members of Biotope 0,

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:19.180
I've got some disciples 
that can be counted on.

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:24.090
I'm sure it'll be fine leaving 
the Human World in their hands.

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:26.360
That aside,

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:29.860
it seems Gourmet Corp has 
been gathering chefs.

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:36.870
If it comes to war, Gourmet Corp will 
probably attack the Human World as well,

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:41.800
but I bet that'd be after they've collected 
a certain number of skilled chefs.

00:17:44.110 --> 00:17:45.610
One month from now,

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:49.850
the greatest chefs from around the 
world will gather for the Cooking Fest.

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:53.780
When that day comes, Gourmet 
Corp is sure to be there.

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:55.520
I see.

00:17:55.520 --> 00:17:57.490
Alright, then.

00:17:57.490 --> 00:18:00.390
I suppose we'll send someone over.

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:03.020
I shall go.

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:04.930
Kosairo!

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:08.400
Chefs are the treasures of the Gourmet Age.

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:12.470
We must save as many of them as we can.

00:18:12.470 --> 00:18:13.800
I see...

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:17.470
Okay then, I'm counting on you, Kosairo.

00:18:17.470 --> 00:18:20.410
Yes, sir. Just leave it to me.

00:18:24.010 --> 00:18:25.150
That's a relief.

00:18:25.510 --> 00:18:28.720
Having you there puts my mind at ease.

00:18:28.720 --> 00:18:32.220
Although this decreases our fighting 
strength here in the Gourmet World...

00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:37.190
I'll just be gone for 
the day of the festival.

00:18:38.360 --> 00:18:39.790
Kuribo.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:44.030
What is it, President?

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:03.920
Those of us who are left will rebuild 
Chowlin Temple with our own power.

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:07.550
Prepare for the danger that is coming.

00:19:07.550 --> 00:19:11.290
And don't either of you 
forget Honoring the Food.

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:13.090
We won't, Master Chin!

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:15.660
Thank you, everyone!

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:22.030
Farewell, Toriko and Komatsu.

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:25.040
Master Chin!

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:27.570
You remembered our names!

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:28.640
That's amazing!

00:19:28.640 --> 00:19:30.810
He still makes mistakes with our names!

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:32.710
I feel like I should apologize...

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:34.210
No, no, not at all!

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:39.980
Something's coming...

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:47.790
Be careful, Toriko and Komatsu.

00:20:24.430 --> 00:20:26.660
This isn't right either.

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:53.190
Well, come if you're going to come, old man.

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:19.750
Under our feet, over our heads

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:27.490
The world is spinning

00:21:30.360 --> 00:21:32.790
A dream flower

00:21:34.030 --> 00:21:36.360
Is blooming, blooming

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:43.400
Tell me the rest, come on

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:47.410
Lead me by the hand

00:21:47.440 --> 00:21:50.780
And take me with you

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:58.180
Don't leave me here alone

00:21:58.590 --> 00:22:02.360
Red shoes

00:22:02.390 --> 00:22:05.590
I can't take off

00:22:05.990 --> 00:22:17.000
I'm the only one dancing

00:22:18.840 --> 00:22:21.840
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:22.340 --> 00:22:27.010
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:26.350 --> 00:22:29.080
Hiding Level
14

00:22:27.010 --> 00:22:29.010
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is 14!

00:22:29.620 --> 00:22:31.720
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds!

00:22:31.720 --> 00:22:35.020
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:36.660 --> 00:22:40.430
Well, this is the country of soothing, Life.

00:22:40.430 --> 00:22:44.030
Where could Yun be?

00:22:45.560 --> 00:22:48.630
Yun is... right here!

00:22:52.200 --> 00:22:53.540
Well?

00:22:53.540 --> 00:22:55.970
The level keeps getting higher, doesn't it?

00:22:55.970 --> 00:23:00.280
I just wish my level as a newscaster 
would increase by a heaping helping!

00:23:00.280 --> 00:23:01.850
But I don't know...

00:23:01.850 --> 00:23:04.220
And now, our next segment!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:07.690
There it is!

00:23:07.690 --> 00:23:11.190
The extremely rare creature that leads  to the Gourmet God Acacia's menu!

00:23:11.470 --> 00:23:13.820
Then the Gourmet Corp. enters the fray, leading to a huge battle!

00:23:13.820 --> 00:23:17.460
Legendary Bee, Infinibee! Toriko vs New-style GT Robot!

00:23:17.760 --> 00:23:19.360
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
